4. WHAT YOU MAY NEVER DO
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

  a) Claim you wrote this.

  b) Take the author's name off it.

  c) Re-license it. You cannot hand anyone rights you were not given.

  d) Use the name "Snatch", the icon, or the logo for your own version. Pick
     your own name. This is so users can tell the difference.

  e) Sue the author over it. See section 6.


