-------------------------------------------------------------------------
7. OTHER PEOPLE'S CODE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

Snatch runs aria2, ffmpeg, yt-dlp, gallery-dl, Wget2 and 7-Zip as separate
programs. It does not contain their code. Each of those keeps its own licence
and is not covered by this one.

Snatch is built with open source Rust libraries. Those keep their own licences
(MIT, Apache-2.0, ISC and MPL-2.0). Run `cargo tree --format "{l} {p}"` to see
the full list.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------
8. IF YOU BREAK THIS LICENCE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

Your rights under it end automatically.

If you fix the problem within 30 days of being told, your rights come back.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------
9. IF YOU SEND CODE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project does not take pull requests. If you paste a fix into an issue,
you are giving the author permission to use it, under this licence, and you
are saying it is yours to give.

You will be credited for it.
